Error: Jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned: `name` was not moved here, so it cannot fill an owned field
  --> Tests/UI/copies_explicit_policy_p31.jet:9:16
    |
  9 |     User{name: name, tags: [String]{}}
    |                ^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Copy it explicitly with `name.copy()`
